### Tüm ürünleri getir — başarılı
GET http://localhost:5155/api/products
Accept: application/json

### Ürün getir — başarılı
GET http://localhost:5155/api/products/1
Accept: application/json

### 404 — NotFoundException → Problem Details
GET http://localhost:5155/api/products/999
Accept: application/json

### Yeni ürün oluştur — başarılı
POST http://localhost:5155/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Keyboard",
  "price": 79.99
}

### 400 — ValidationException → Problem Details (boş name)
POST http://localhost:5155/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "price": -1
}

### 409 — ConflictException → Problem Details (aynı isim)
POST http://localhost:5155/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Laptop",
  "price": 999.99
}

### 403 — ForbiddenException → Problem Details (User rolü)
DELETE http://localhost:5155/api/products/1?role=User

### 204 — başarılı silme (Admin rolü)
DELETE http://localhost:5155/api/products/1?role=Admin

### 500 — beklenmedik hata → Problem Details
GET http://localhost:5155/api/products/error
Accept: application/json